OL,3,GNEWSAI was hidden in an attic as a baby
OL,4,A- then sent to a notorious orphanage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatrick Fox had always wanted to write
OL,7,Fthe story of his life.
OL,9,FBut when the 75-year-old sat down in
OL,10,Fhis Worcestershire home to get started,
OL,11,Fhe found he was unable to put pen to
OL,12,Fpaper.
OL,14,FFirst he had to confront the
OL,15,Fdifficulties of his childhood - from
OL,16,Fhis earliest years living in an attic,
OL,17,Fbefore moving into a notorious care
OL,18,Fhome where it was later uncovered boys
OL,19,Fhad suffered years of sexual abuse.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
