OL,3,GNEWSAI was hidden in an attic as a baby
OL,4,A- then sent to a notorious orphanage
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut being able to share his
OL,7,Fexperiences, he says, has helped him
OL,8,Ffeel a weight has been lifted, and he
OL,9,Fnow hopes it will help others with
OL,10,Fsimilar experiences.
